      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARD RIGHT (4) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw then burst clear to score (22.32) at this track in a Grade 5 over 388m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Form reads well for this. REBORN SPARK (7) placed in a NG when a 3 length second this course and distance last time in a personal Best Time (22.08) and also clocked one of the quickest times on the card. Top run latest and rates a key player again. CRAFTY CHAP (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing seventh (26.08) last time in a Mix 1/2/3 at Lithgow. Has a good record at this journey. Comes through a solid form race last start. Should be in this for a long way. MAGIC WYLDE (8) hit the frame here last time and looks a chance again.",
